  "historyNote": "#5646, eff 6-23-93; ss by #7020, INTERIM, eff 6-23-99, EXPIRED: 10-21-99 New. #9292, eff 10-9-08, EXPIRED: 10-9-16 New. #12168, INTERIM, eff 4-29-17, EXPIRED: 10-26-17 New. #12642, eff 10-9-18",
